description:
Implement a circuit that converts a 4-bit binary input into its corresponding 4-bit hexadecimal output. The module utilizes a combinational logic structure to map each of the 16 possible binary values (from 0000 to 1111) directly to their hexadecimal equivalents (from 0 to F). The output is driven by a case statement based on the input binary value, allowing for real-time conversion without additional clock synchronization.
module top_module(
    input [3:0] binary,
    output reg [3:0] hex
);

