description:
Design a four-to-sixteen decoder that takes a 2-bit input (sel) and outputs one of sixteen possible lines. Based on the value of sel, the corresponding output line is driven HIGH (1), while all other outputs remain LOW (0). If sel is not within the defined range, the output defaults to all LOWs.
module top_module(
    input [1:0] sel,
    output reg [15:0] out
);

code:
module top_module(
    input [1:0] sel,
    output reg [15:0] out
);always @(*) begin
        case(sel)
            2'b00: out = 16'b0000000000000001;
            2'b01: out = 16'b0000000000000010;
            2'b10: out = 16'b0000000000000100;
            2'b11: out = 16'b0000000000001000;
            default: out = 16'b0000000000000000;
        endcase
    end

endmodule

