Design a 4-to-1 multiplexer that selects one of four input data bits based on a 2-bit select signal. The module outputs the selected data bit to the output line, where sel=00 corresponds to data[0], sel=01 to data[1], sel=10 to data[2], and sel=11 to data[3].
module top_module(
  input [1:0] sel,
  input [3:0] data,
  output reg out
);

