Design a 4-to-1 multiplexer that selects one of four 32-bit wide input signals (in0, in1, in2, in3) based on a 2-bit selector input (Op). The output (MuxOut) reflects the value of the selected input, where Op=00 corresponds to in0, Op=01 to in1, Op=10 to in2, and Op=11 to in3.
